na','Log content'=>'Akopọ log','Size'=>'Iwọn','Created on'=>'Ti ṣẹda ni','Modified on'=>'Ti yipada ni','Delete file'=>'Pa faili','Debug data'=>'Data debug','Log File'=>'Faili Log','Log file not found.'=>'Faili log ko ri.','If you see any error or look for information regarding PublishPress, please don\'t hesitate to contact the support team. E-mail us:'=>'Ti o ba rii eyikeyi aṣiṣe tabi wa alaye nipa PublishPress, jọwọ ma ṣe ṣiyemeji lati kan si ẹgbẹ atilẹyin. Fi imeeli ranṣẹ si wa:','Click to delete the log file. Be careful, this operation can not be undone. '=>'Tẹ lati pa faili log. Ṣọra, iṣẹ yii ko le yipada.','Action nonce not found.'=>'Aisi action nonce.','Invalid action nonce.'=>'Action nonce ti ko tọ.','Editorial Comments'=>'Awọn asọye akọsilẹ','Choose Post Types'=>'Yan Awọn irufẹ Ifiweranṣẹ','<p>Editorial comments help you cut down on email overload and keep the conversation close to where it matters: your content. Threaded commenting in the admin, similar to what you find at the end of a blog post, allows writers and editors to privately leave feedback and discuss what needs to be changed before publication.</p><p>Anyone with access to view the story in progress will also have the ability to comment on it. If you have notifications enabled, those following the post will receive an email every time a comment is left.</p>'=>'<p>Awọn ọrọ-ọrọ ẹlẹrọ n ṣe iranlọwọ fun ọ lati dinku ikọlu imeeli ati ki o pa ibaraẹnisọrọ sunmọ ibi ti o ṣe pataki: akoonu rẹ. Awọn ọrọ-ọrọ ti a fi kún ninu iṣakoso, ti o jọra si ohun ti o rii ni ipari ifiweranṣẹ bulọọgi kan, gba awọn onkọwe ati awọn olootu laaye lati fi esi silẹ ni ikọkọ ki o si jiroro lori ohun ti o nilo lati yipada ṣaaju itẹjade.</p><p>Ẹnikẹni ti o ni iraye si lati wo itan ti n lọ yoo tun ni anfani lati sọ asọye lori rẹ. Ti o ba ni awọn ikilọ ti a mu ṣiṣẹ, awọn ti o tẹle ifiweranṣẹ naa yoo gba imeeli ni gbogbo igba ti a ba fi asọye silẹ.</p>','<p><strong>For more information:</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/editorial-comments/">Editorial Comments Documentation</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">PublishPress on Github</a></p>'=>'<p><strong>Fun alaye diẹ sii:</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/editorial-comments/">Iwe Itọsọna Awọn ọrọ-ọrọ Ẹlẹrọ</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">PublishPress lori Github</a></p>','Remove'=>'Yọkuro','All Posts'=>'Gbogbo Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ','All Users'=>'Gbogbo Awọn olumulo','Search results for &#8220;%s&#8221;'=>'Abajade wiwa fun &#8220;%s&#8221;','Search Comments'=>'Wa Awọn ikọkọ','You can add editorial comments to a post once you\'ve saved it for the first time.'=>'O le ṣafikun awọn ọrọ-ọrọ ẹlẹrọ si ifiweranṣẹ kan ni kete ti o ba ti fipamọ rẹ fun igba akọkọ.','Add an editorial comment'=>'Fi ikọkọ olootu kun','Attach file'=>'So faili pọ','Add Comment'=>'Fi Ikọkọ Kun','Reply to this comment'=>'Fesi si ikọkọ yii','Reply'=>'Fesi','Delete'=>'Pa','said on %1$s at %2$s'=>'sọrọ lori %1$s ni %2$s','Nonce check failed. Please ensure you\'re supposed to be adding editorial comments.'=>'Ayẹwo nonce kuna. Jọwọ rii daju pe o yẹ ki o n ṣafikun awọn ọrọ-ọrọ ẹlẹrọ.','Invalid comment data'=>'Data ikọkọ ti ko tọ','Sorry, you don\'t have the privileges to add editorial comments. Please talk to your Administrator.'=>'E ma binu, o ko ni awọn anfani lati ṣafikun awọn ọrọ-ọrọ ẹlẹrọ. Jọwọ sọrọ pẹlu Alakoso rẹ.','Please enter a comment.'=>'Jọwọ tẹ ikọkọ kan sii.','There was a problem of some sort. Try again or contact your administrator.'=>'Iṣoro kan wa. Gbiyanju lẹẹkan si tabi kan si alakoso rẹ.','Nonce check failed. Please ensure you\'re supposed to be editing editorial comments.'=>'Ayẹwo nonce kuna. Jọwọ rii daju pe o yẹ ki o n ṣatunkọ awọn ọrọ-ọrọ ẹlẹrọ.','Sorry, you don\'t have the privileges to edit editorial comments. Please talk to your Administrator.'=>'E ma binu, o ko ni awọn anfani lati ṣatunkọ awọn ọrọ-ọrọ ẹlẹrọ. Jọwọ sọrọ pẹlu Alakoso rẹ.','Sorry, you don\'t have the privileges to edit this editorial comment. Please talk to your Administrator.'=>'E ma binu, o ko ni awọn anfani lati ṣe atunṣe ọrọ iroyin yii. Jọwọ ba Alakoso rẹ sọrọ.','Sorry, you don\'t have the privileges to delete this editorial comment. Please talk to your Administrator.'=>'E ma binu, o ko ni awọn anfani lati pa ọrọ iroyin yii. Jọwọ ba Alakoso rẹ sọrọ.','Sorry, you can\'t delete this editorial comment because it has some replies.'=>'E ma binu, o ko le pa asọye olootu yii nitori o ni diẹ ninu awọn idahun.','Comment deleted successfully.'=>'Asọye ti paarẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Enable for these post types:'=>'Mú ṣiṣẹ fun awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ wọnyi:','Comment author name field:'=>'Ìkàwé orukọ onkọwe asọye:','Nickname'=>'Orukọ ìbáṣepọ','Username'=>'Orukọ olumulo','Display Name'=>'Orukọ ifihan','First Name'=>'Orukọ akọkọ','Last Name'=>'Orukọ ikẹhin','Email'=>'Imeeli','User Url'=>'Url olumulo','No editorial comments.'=>'Ko si awọn asọye olootu.','Filter by post'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ nipasẹ ifiweranṣẹ','Filter by user'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ nipasẹ olumulo','Filter'=>'Àlẹmọ','Comment'=>'Asọye','Post'=>'Ifiweranṣẹ','Submitted on'=>'Ti fi silẹ ni','%1$s at %2$s'=>'%1$s ni %2$s','Editorial fields term added.'=>'Ìpinnu aaye olootu ti ṣafikun.','Editorial fields term updated.'=>'Ìpinnu aaye olootu ti ṣe imudojuiwọn.','Editorial fields term doesn\'t exist.'=>'Ìpinnu aaye olootu ko si.','Editorial fields term deleted.'=>'Ìpinnu aaye olootu ti paarẹ.','Editorial fields order updated.'=>'Àtúnṣe àṣẹ àwọn àkọsílẹ́ ìtẹ́wọ́gbà.','Editorial fields visibility changed.'=>'Àtúnṣe ìfihàn àwọn àkọsílẹ́ ìtẹ́wọ́gbà.','<p>Keep track of important details about your content with editorial fields. This feature allows you to create as many date, text, number, etc. fields as you like, and then use them to store information like contact details or the location of an interview.</p><p>Once you’ve set your fields up, editorial fields integrates with both the calendar and the content overview. Make an editorial fields item visible to have it appear to the rest of your team. Keep it hidden to restrict the information between the writer and their editor.</p>'=>'<p>Tọju awọn alaye pataki nipa akoonu rẹ pẹlu awọn aaye iroyin. Ẹya yii gba ọ laaye lati ṣẹda ọpọlọpọ awọn aaye ọjọ, ọrọ, nọmba, ati bẹbẹ lọ, gẹgẹ bi o ṣe fẹ, ati lẹhinna lo wọn lati fipamọ alaye bii awọn alaye olubasọrọ tabi ipo ibere ijomitoro.</p><p>Lẹ́yìn tí o ti ṣètò àwọn àyè rẹ, àwọn àyè iroyin darapọ mọ mejeeji kalẹnda ati akopọ akoonu. Ṣe ẹya aaye iroyin han lati jẹ ki o han si awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ rẹ. Tọju rẹ ni ikoko lati dènà alaye laarin onkọwe ati olootu wọn.</p>','<p><strong>For more information:</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/editorial-metadata/">Editorial Fields Documentation</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">PublishPress on Github</a></p>'=>'<p><strong>Fun alaye diẹ sii:</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/editorial-metadata/">Iwe Itọsọna Awoṣe Iroyin</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">PublishPress lori Github</a></p>','First Draft Date'=>'Ọjọ́ Àkọ́kọ́ Ìtẹ́wọ́gbà','When the first draft needs to be ready.'=>'Nígbà tí àkọ́kọ́ ìtẹ́wọ́gbà bá nílò láti jẹ́ ready.','Assignment'=>'Àṣẹ','What the post needs to cover.'=>'Kí ni ìkọ̀wé náà nílò láti bo.','Checkbox'=>'Àyẹ̀wò','Dropdown Select'=>'Yiyan Àkópọ̀','Location'=>'Ipo','Number'=>'Nọ́mbà','Paragraph'=>'Párágrafu','Text'=>'Ọrọ','User'=>'Olumulo','Are you sure you want to delete this term? Any metadata for this term will remain but will not be visible unless this term is re-added.'=>'Ṣe o da ọ loju pe o fẹ pa ọrọ yii? Gbogbo metadata fun ọrọ yii yoo wa ṣugbọn ko ni han ayafi ti a ba tun fi ọrọ yii kun.','Search Editorial Fields'=>'Wa Àwọn Àkọsílẹ́ Ìtẹ́wọ́gbà','Popular Editorial Fields'=>'Àwọn Àkọsílẹ́ Ìtẹ́wọ́gbà tó gbajúmọ̀','All Editorial Fields'=>'Gbogbo Àkọsílẹ́ Ìtẹ́wọ́gbà','Edit Editorial Fields'=>'Ṣatunkọ Àwọn Àkọsílẹ́ Ìtẹ́wọ́gbà','Update Editorial Fields'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn aaye atẹjade','Add New Editorial Fields'=>'Fi awọn aaye atẹjade tuntun kun','New Editorial Fields'=>'Awọn aaye atẹjade tuntun','No editorial fields available.'=>'Ko si awọn aaye atẹjade ti o wa.',' <a href="%s">Add fields to get started</a>.'=>' <a href="%s">Fi awọn aaye kun lati bẹrẹ</a>.',' Encourage your site administrator to configure your editorial workflow by adding editorial fields.'=>'Gba alakoso aaye rẹ niyanju lati tunto ilana iṣẹ iroyin rẹ nipa fifi awọn aaye iroyin kun.','All options value and labels are required.'=>'Gbogbo awọn iye aṣayan ati awọn aami jẹ dandan.','Please enter a name for the editorial fields.'=>'Jọwọ tẹ orukọ kan fun awọn aaye atẹjade.','Please enter a slug for the editorial fields.'=>'Jọwọ tẹ slug kan fun awọn aaye atẹjade.','Name conflicts with existing term. Please choose another.'=>'Orukọ naa n ja pẹlu ọrọ to wa tẹlẹ. Jọwọ yan omiran.','Name already in use. Please choose another.'=>'Orukọ naa ti lo tẹlẹ. Jọwọ yan omiran.','Slug already in use. Please choose another.'=>'Slug naa ti lo tẹlẹ. Jọwọ yan omiran.','Name cannot exceed 200 characters. Please try a shorter name.'=>'Orukọ ko le kọja awọn ohun kikọ 200. Jọwọ gbiyanju orukọ ti o kuru diẹ.','Please select a valid metadata type.'=>'Jọwọ yan iru metadata to wulo.','Error adding term.'=>'Aṣiṣe ni fifi ọrọ kun.','Please enter a name for the editorial fields'=>'Jọwọ tẹ orukọ kan fun awọn aaye atẹjade','Please enter a valid, non-numeric name for the editorial fields.'=>'Jọwọ tẹ orukọ to wulo, ti kii ṣe nọmba fun awọn aaye atẹjade.','Metadata name conflicts with existing term. Please choose another.'=>'Orukọ metadata n ja pẹlu ọrọ to wa tẹlẹ. Jọwọ yan omiran.','Name conflicts with slug for another term. Please choose something else.'=>'Orukọ naa n ja pẹlu slug fun ọrọ miiran. Jọwọ yan nkan miiran.','Error updating term.'=>'Aṣiṣe ni imudojuiwọn ọrọ.','Terms not set.'=>'Awọn ofin ko ti ṣeto.','Error deleting term.'=>'Aṣiṣe ni piparẹ ofin.','Register editorial fields for these post types:'=>'Forukọsilẹ awọn aaye akọwe fun awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ wọnyi:','No'=>'Rara','Yes'=>'Bẹẹni','This editorial fields type is not yet supported.'=>'Iru aaye akọwe yii ko ti ni atilẹyin sibẹsibẹ.','Not set'=>'Ko ti ṣeto','View &#8220;%s&#8221; on Google Maps'=>'Wo &#8220;%s&#8221; lori Google Maps','-- Select %s --'=>'-- Yan %s --','-- Select a user --'=>'-- Yan olumulo kan --','Position'=>'Ipo','Name'=>'Orukọ','Post Types'=>'Iru Ifiweranṣẹ','Field Type'=>'Iru Aaye','Description'=>'Apejuwe','No editorial fields found.'=>'Ko si awọn aaye akọwe ti a ri.','The name is for labeling the editorial fields.'=>'Orukọ naa jẹ fun aami awọn aaye akọwe.','Slug'=>'Slug','The slug cannot be changed once the term has been created.'=>'Slug ko le yipada ni kete ti ofin ti ṣẹda.','The description can be used to communicate with your team about what the field is for.'=>'Apejuwe le ṣee lo lati ba ẹgbẹ rẹ sọrọ nipa ohun ti aaye naa jẹ.','Type'=>'Iru','The field type cannot be changed once created.'=>'Iru aaye naa ko le yipada lẹ́yìn tí a ti dá a sílẹ̀.','User role'=>'Iṣẹ́ olumulo','Select roles...'=>'Yan awọn iṣẹ́...','Filter the list of users in the editorial meta to users in the selected roles.'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ atokọ awọn olumulo ninu metadata iroyin si awọn olumulo ni awọn ipa ti a yan.','Select Type'=>'Yan Iru','Single Select'=>'Yan Ẹ̀yà Kan','Multiple Select'=>'Yan Ọ̀pọ̀ Ẹ̀yà','Indicate the select type.'=>'Ṣàpèjúwe iru yiyan naa.','Dropdown Option'=>'Àṣàyàn Apoti','Enter the dropdown option value and label. You can move options to change their order.'=>'Tẹ iye aṣayan dropdown ati akọle. O le gbe awọn aṣayan lati yipada ibẹ wọn.','Meta Value'=>'Iye Meta','Display Label'=>'Akọle Ifihan','Default option'=>'Àṣàyàn aiyipada','Add Another Option'=>'Fi Àṣàyàn Míràn Kún','Show on Content Calendar and Overview form'=>'Fihan lori Kálẹ́ńdà Àkópọ̀ àti fọọmu Àkópọ̀','If enabled, this field will be available when adding new posts on the Content Calendar and Overview screen.'=>'Ti a ba mu ṣiṣẹ, aaye yii yoo wa nigba fifi awọn ifiweranṣẹ tuntun kun lori Kalẹnda Akoonu ati iboju Akopọ.','Add to post types'=>'Fi kun awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ','This field will be available for these post types.'=>'Aaye yii yoo wa fun awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ wọnyi.','Show on Post Types screen'=>'Fihan lori iboju Awọn Iru Ifiweranṣẹ','This field will be viewable on the overview screens for these post types.'=>'Aaye yii yoo jẹ kó ye lori awọn iboju àkópọ̀ fun awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ wọnyi.','Update Editorial fields term'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn agbegbe akọsilẹ','The "slug" is the URL-friendly version of the name. It is usually all lowercase and contains only letters, numbers, and hyphens.'=>'“Slug” ni ẹya URL-fẹran ti orukọ. O maa n jẹ gbogbo awọn lẹta kekere ati pe o ni awọn lẹta, nọmba, ati awọn hyphen nikan.','The description can be used to communicate with your team about what the metadata is for.'=>'Apejuwe le ṣee lo lati ba ẹgbẹ rẹ sọrọ nipa ohun ti metadata jẹ.','Indicate the type of editorial fields.'=>'Ṣalaye iru awọn agbegbe akọsilẹ.','Add New Editorial fields term'=>'Fi Term Awọn agbegbe akọsilẹ tuntun kun','Edit Flow should not be used alongside PublishPress Planner. If you want to use PublishPress Planner, please complete Edit Flow data migration and then deactivate Edit Flow.'=>'Edit Flow ko yẹ ki o lo ni ẹgbẹ pẹlu PublishPress Planner. Ti o ba fẹ lo PublishPress Planner, jọwọ pari gbigbe data Edit Flow ki o si pa Edit Flow.','Advanced Notifications'=>'Awọn iwifunni ilọsiwaju','Duplicated notification threshold:'=>'Iwọn iwifunni ti a daakọ:','Default notification channels:'=>'Iwọn iwifunni aiyipada:','Existing Post is updated'=>'Ifiweranṣẹ ti o wa ti ni imudojuiwọn','New Post is created in Draft status'=>'Ifiweranṣẹ tuntun ti ṣẹda ni ipo Iwe afọwọkọ','New Post is Published'=>'Ifiweranṣẹ tuntun ti tẹjade','Notify on editorial comments'=>'Ṣe iwifunni lori awọn akọsilẹ akọsilẹ','minutes'=>'iwa','This will prevent too many notifications being sent for the same or similar events. Set this to a higher number if you are receiving duplicate emails.'=>'Eyi yoo dènà ọpọlọpọ awọn ìkìlọ ti a fi ranṣẹ fun awọn iṣẹlẹ kanna tabi ti o jọra. Ṣeto eyi si nọmba ti o ga julọ ti o ba n gba awọn imeeli ẹda.','Editorial Notifications'=>'Awọn iwifunni akọsilẹ','Choose the channels where each workflow will send notifications to:'=>'Yan awọn ikanni nibiti iṣẹ-ṣiṣe kọọkan yoo firanṣẹ awọn iwifunni:','Muted'=>'Ti a ti mu','Workflows'=>'Awọn iṣẹ-ṣiṣe','Channels'=>'Awọn ikanni','Notifications Log'=>'Iwe Itan Awọn Ifitonileti','Workflow Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Ilana Ọna','Options'=>'Awọn aṣayan','Help'=>'Iranlọwọ','When to notify?'=>'Nigbawo ni lati kede?','For which content?'=>'Fun iru akoonu wo?','Who to notify?'=>'Tani lati kede?','What to say?'=>'Kini lati sọ?','Select at least one option for each section.'=>'Yan o kere ju aṣayan kan fun apakan kọọkan.','You can add dynamic information to the Subject or Body text using the following shortcodes:'=>'O le fi alaye iyipada kun si akọle tabi ọrọ Ara nipa lilo awọn koodu kukuru wọnyi:','Editorial Comment'=>'Iwe Iṣeduro','User making changes or comments'=>'Olumulo ti n ṣe awọn ayipada tabi awọn akọsilẹ','Workflow'=>'Ilana Ọna','Format'=>'Fọọmu','Receiver'=>'Olugba','shortcode'=>'koodu kukuru','field'=>'pẹpẹ','On each shortcode, you can select one or more fields. If more than one, they will be displayed separated by ", ".'=>'Ninu koodu kukuru kọọkan, o le yan ọkan tabi diẹ ẹ sii awọn aaye. Ti o ba ju ọkan lọ, wọn yoo han ni pipin nipasẹ “, ”.','Available fields'=>'Awọn pẹpẹ ti o wa','Meta fields'=>'Awọn pẹpẹ Meta','Click here to read more about shortcode options...'=>'Tẹ nibi lati ka siwaju nipa awọn aṣayan koodu kukuru...','Features'=>'Awọn ẹya','Feel free to select only the features you need.'=>'Maṣe ṣiyemeji lati yan awọn ẹya ti o nilo nikan.','Enabled features'=>'Awọn ẹya ti a mu ṣiṣẹ','Invalid receiver for the notification'=>'Olugba ti ko tọ fun iwifunni','Invalid channel for the notification'=>'Ikanni ti ko tọ fun iwifunni','Notification log not found'=>'Iwe itan iwifunni ko ri','The parent log was deleted or probably rescheduled'=>'Iwe itan obi ti paarẹ tabi boya ti tunto','Workflow: %s'=>'Iṣẹ-ṣiṣe: %s','User: %s (%d)'=>'Olumulo: %s (%d)','Post type: %s'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ: %s','Post ID: %d'=>'ID ifiweranṣẹ: %d','Blog ID: %d'=>'ID bulọọgi: %d','Scheduled for %d receivers. Click here to display them.'=>'Tito lẹsẹsẹ fun %d awọn olugba. Tẹ nibi lati fi hàn wọn.',' Scheduled, but late'=>' Ti ṣeto, ṣugbọn pẹ',' Scheduled'=>' Ti ṣeto','Error'=>'Aṣiṣe','The notification was set as "Scheduled" but the cron task is not found'=>'Iwifunni ti ṣeto bi "Ti ṣeto" ṣugbọn iṣẹ cron ko ri','Sent'=>'Ti ranṣẹ','Skipped'=>'Ti fo','asynchronous'=>'asynchronous','synchronous'=>'synchronous','Reschedule'=>'Tun eto','Blog: '=>'Blog: ','Delete All'=>'Pa Gbogbo','All'=>'Gbogbo','Success'=>'Aseyori','Filter by workflow'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ nipasẹ iṣẹ-ṣiṣe','Filter by event'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ nipasẹ iṣẹlẹ','All events'=>'Gbogbo awọn iṣẹlẹ','Filter by channel'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ nipasẹ ikanni','All channels'=>'Gbogbo awọn ikanni','From date'=>'Lati ọjọ','To date'=>'Si ọjọ','Filter by receiver'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ nipasẹ olugba','All Receivers'=>'Gbogbo awọn Olugba','All Workflows'=>'Gbogbo awọn Ilana iṣẹ','All Actions'=>'Gbogbo awọn Iṣe','All Channels'=>'Gbogbo awọn Ikanni','All Statuses'=>'Gbogbo awọn Ipo','Notification'=>'Ikilọ','%s notification found.'=>'%s ikilọ ti wa.','No notifications found.'=>'Ko si awọn ikilọ ti wa.','This notification is very similar to another one sent less than %d minutes ago for the same receiver'=>'Ìkìlọ yìí dára tó bí ìkìlọ mìíràn tó kó lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ́ ju %d iṣẹ́ju sẹ́yìn lọ fún olugba kanna','Subject:'=>'Kókó:','Content:'=>'Ak conteúdo:','This is a preview of the scheduled message. The content can still change until the notification is sent.'=>'Eyi ni iwoye ti ifiranṣẹ ti a gbero. Akoonu naa le ṣi yipada titi di igba ti ìkìlọ naa ba firanṣẹ.','Notifications'=>'Ikilọ','<p>Notifications ensure you keep up to date with progress your most important content. Users can be subscribed to notifications on a post one by one or by selecting roles.</p><p>When enabled, notifications can be sent when a post changes status or an editorial comment is left by a writer or an editor.</p>'=>'<p>Ìkìlọ ṣe idaniloju pe o n tọju imudojuiwọn pẹlu ilọsiwaju akoonu rẹ ti o ṣe pataki julọ. Awọn olumulo le forukọsilẹ si awọn ìkìlọ lori ifiweranṣẹ ọkan lẹkan tabi nipa yiyan awọn ipa.</p><p>Nigbati a ba mu ṣiṣẹ, awọn ìkìlọ le ṣee firanṣẹ nigbati ifiweranṣẹ ba yipada ipo tabi ọrọ iroyin ba wa lati ọdọ onkọwe tabi olootu.</p>','<p><strong>For more information:</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/notifications/">Notifications Documentation</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">PublishPress on Github</a></p>'=>'<p><strong>Fun alaye diẹ sii:</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/notifications/">Iwe Itọsọna Ìkìlọ</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">PublishPress lori Github</a></p>','Notify User'=>'Kilọ Olumulo','Notify Users'=>'Kilọ Awọn Olumulo','Notify Role'=>'Kilọ Ipa','Notify Roles'=>'Kilọ Awọn Ipa','Notification Group'=>'Ẹgbẹ Ikilọ','Notification Groups'=>'Ẹgbẹ Ikilọ','Notify Email'=>'Kilọ Imeeli','Notify Emails'=>'Kilọ Awọn Imeeli','Click to stop being notified on updates for this post'=>'Tẹ lati da ikilọ duro lori awọn imudojuiwọn fun ifiweranṣẹ yii','Stop notifying me'=>'Dẹrọ ikilọ mi','Click to start being notified on updates for this post'=>'Tẹ lati bẹrẹ gbigba ikilọ lori awọn imudojuiwọn fun ifiweranṣẹ yii','Notify me'=>'Kilọ mi','Enter users, roles, or email addresses that should receive notifications for this post.'=>'Tẹ awọn olumulo, awọn ipa, tabi awọn adirẹsi imeeli ti o yẹ ki o gba awọn iwifunni fun ifiweranṣẹ yii.','Show active notifications'=>'Fihan awọn ikilọ to wa','This won\'t have any effect unless you have at least one workflow targeting the "Users who selected "Notify me" for the content" option.'=>'Eyi kii yoo ni ipa eyikeyi ayafi ti o ba ni o kere ju iṣẹ ọna kan ti o ni ibi-afẹde "Awọn olumulo ti o yan "Jẹ ki n mọ" fun akoonu" aṣayan.','Active Notifications'=>'Awọn Ikilọ to wa','Workflow has users enrolled'=>'Iṣẹ́ àtúnṣe ni awọn olumulo ti wọlé','No active notifications found for this %s.'=>'Ko si awọn ìkìlọ̀ iṣẹ́ tó n ṣiṣẹ́ fún %s yìí.','You are receiving this email because you are subscribed to "%s".'=>'O n gba imeeli yìí nitori o ti forukọsilẹ si "%s".','This email was sent %s.'=>'Imeeli yìí ni a rán %s.','Show the "Notify me" and "Stop notifying me" links for these post types:'=>'Fihan awọn ìjápọ̀ "Ṣàkíyèsí mí" àti "Dákẹ́ àkíyèsí mí" fún àwọn irú àpo yìí:','Email from:'=>'Imeeli láti:','Always notify the author of the content:'=>'Ṣe àkíyèsí nigbagbogbo fun onkọwe akoonu:','Always notify users who have edited the content:'=>'Ṣe àkíyèsí nigbagbogbo fun awọn olumulo ti yipada akoonu:','Blacklisted taxonomies for Notifications'=>'Àwọn taxonomies tí a dènà fún Àkíyèsí','slug1,slug2'=>'slug1,slug2','Add a list of taxonomy-slugs separated by comma that should not be loaded by the Taxonomy content filter when adding a new Notification Workflow.'=>'Fikun-un akojọ awọn taxonomy-slugs ti o pin nipasẹ koma ti ko yẹ ki o gba nipasẹ asẹ akoonu Taxonomy nigbati o ba nfi iṣẹ ṣiṣe iwifunni tuntun kun.','WordPress Scheduler'=>'Oníṣe ipò WordPress','[%1$s] New %2$s Created: "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] Tuntun %2$s ti dá: "%3$s"','A new %1$s (#%2$s "%3$s" ) was created by %4$s %5$s'=>'A ṣẹda tuntun %1$s (#%2$s "%3$s") nipasẹ %4$s %5$s','[%1$s] %2$s Trashed: "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s ti sọ di àtẹ̀jáde: "%3$s"','%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" was moved to the trash by %4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" ni a gbe lọ si àtẹ̀jáde nipasẹ %4$s %5$s','[%1$s] %2$s Restored (from Trash ): "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s ti tún pada (lati Àtẹ̀jáde): "%3$s"','%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" was restored from trash by %4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" ni a tún pada lati àtẹ̀jáde nipasẹ %4$s %5$s','[%1$s] %2$s Published: "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s ti tẹ̀jáde: "%3$s"','%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" was published by %4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" ni a tẹ̀jáde nipasẹ %4$s %5$s','[%1$s] %2$s Unpublished: "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s Ti a kò tẹjade: "%3$s"','%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" was unpublished by %4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" ti a kò tẹjade nipasẹ %4$s %5$s','[%1$s] %2$s Status Changed for "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s Ipo ti yipada fun "%3$s"','Status was changed for %1$s #%2$s "%3$s" by %4$s %5$s'=>'Ipo ti yipada fun %1$s #%2$s "%3$s" nipasẹ %4$s %5$s','This action was taken on %1$s at %2$s %3$s'=>'Iṣe yi ni a ṣe lori %1$s ni %2$s %3$s','%1$s => %2$s'=>'%1$s => %2$s','== %s Details =='=>'== %s Alaye ==','Title: %s'=>'Ak title: %s','Author: %1$s (%2$s )'=>'Onkọwe: %1$s (%2$s )','== Actions =='=>'== Iṣe ==','Add editorial comment: %s'=>'Fi ọrọ ìtúnṣe kun: %s','Edit: %s'=>'Ṣatunkọ: %s','View: %s'=>'Wo: %s','[%1$s] New Editorial Comment: "%2$s"'=>'[%1$s] Ọrọ ìtúnṣe tuntun: "%2$s"','A new editorial comment was added to %3$s #%1$s "%2$s"'=>'Ọrọ ìtúnṣe tuntun kan ti fi kun %3$s #%1$s "%2$s"','%1$s (%2$s ) said on %3$s at %4$s:'=>'%1$s (%2$s ) sọ lori %3$s ni %4$s:','Reply: %s'=>'Dáhùn: %s','You can see all editorial comments on this %s here: '=>'O le wo gbogbo awọn ọrọ ìtúnṣe lori %s yi nibi: ','Reviews'=>'Atunwo','settings'=>'eto','PublishPress Settings'=>'Iṣeto PublishPress','Settings'=>'Iṣeto','PublishPress Planner'=>'PublishPress Planner','If you like %s please leave us a %s rating. Thank you!'=>'Ti o ba fẹ %s jọwọ fi wa silẹ %s igbasilẹ. O ṣeun!','There are no PublishPress modules registered'=>'Ko si awọn module PublishPress ti a forukọsilẹ','Disabled because add_post_type_support(\'%1$s\', \'%2$s\') is included in a loaded file.'=>'Ti dènà nitori add_post_type_support(\'%1$s\', \'%2$s\') ti wa ni akọọlẹ ninu faili ti a gba.','Cheatin&#8217; uh?'=>'Ṣe o nṣe ẹtan&#8217;?','About'=>'Nipa','Documentation'=>'Ijẹrisi','Contact'=>'Kan si','The Events Calendar Integration'=>'Iṣọpọ Kalandar Awọn Iṣẹlẹ','Integrate with the The Events Calendar plugin'=>'Ṣopọ pẹlu plugin Kalandar Awọn Iṣẹlẹ','Planner'=>'Eto','Configure'=>'Ṣeto','Please correct your form errors below and try again.'=>'Jọwọ ṣatunṣe awọn aṣiṣe fọọmu rẹ ni isalẹ ki o gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','You do not have necessary permissions to complete this action.'=>'Iwọ ko ni awọn aṣẹ pataki lati pari iṣe yii.','Post does not exist'=>'Ifiweranṣẹ ko si','Add New Notification'=>'Fi Ifojusi Tuntun Kun','Edit Notification'=>'Ṣatunkọ Ifojusi','Search Notifications'=>'Wa Awọn Ifojusi','No notification found'=>'Ko si ifojusi ti a ri','PublishPress Planner tried to load multiple times. Please, deactivate and remove other instances of PublishPress, specially if you are using PublishPress Pro.'=>'PublishPress Planner gbiyanju lati gba ọpọlọpọ igba. Jọwọ, pa ati yọ awọn olumulo miiran ti PublishPress, paapaa ti o ba nlo PublishPress Pro.','Warning'=>'Ikilo','%1$s = start date, %2$s = end date %1$s <div class="input-divider">to</div> %2$s'=>' %1$s <div class="input-divider">si</div> %2$s','taxonomy general nameEditorial Field'=>'Ibi Iwe Iroyin','taxonomy singular nameEditorial Field'=>'Ibi Iwe iroyin']];